# The trial of pod-e2e in podssh, at its main 74760e8: podssh-relay's
# src/e2e/ is glue over pod-e2e (podssh's process documents of the net,
# its process holds of the channels with its Movable of the pipe, and its
# lines of a node's events); each node's end takes the glue's events, docs
# and holds; the operator's end of the CLI and of the blocking facade takes
# the installed documents. The tests of the channel and the plants of e2e/
# leave podssh (pod-e2e's); e2e_layered.rs and the harness stay. snow leaves
# the workspace. Each podcrates tag moves to the tag of the hand-off. The
# record with its citations, the repository checks; the builds of the
# default features and of the release's features; the checks of the
# features of the gate; clippy with the lints that the gate allows, with
# each feature of podssh-relay; the tests of podssh-relay and podssh-cli
# that run the channel, a node's end, its person, its grants, its routes,
# the net, the blocking facade or a handover; rustfmt of the crates that the
# patch changes; each Rust toolchain of the workflows and build images
# against the rust-version of podcrates; each test target that the gate
# names; the binary of the release's features for x86_64 musl, built with
# zig (a debug build: the release profile takes LTO), and podssh's static
# check of it.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
cargo build -q
cargo check -q -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-core -p podssh-probe -p podssh-warp --features podssh-relay/blocking,podssh-relay/quick,podssh-relay/quic,podssh-relay/derp,podssh-relay/piping,podssh-relay/opentunnel,podssh-relay/code,podssh-relay/warp,podssh-relay/grant,podssh-relay/serve,podssh-relay/bore
cargo build -q -p podssh-cli --features iroh,warp
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -p podssh-iroh -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-relay --all-features -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-relay --all-features --lib --test e2e_layered --test grant --test quick_exit --test relay_serve_once --test routes_shared --test bore_link --test session_policy --test session_relay_resume --test reverse_layered
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib --test channel_cli --test chat_converse --test cloudflare_layer_alive --test node_moves --test node_ask --test node_routes --test net --test exit --test node
cargo fmt -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-tests.py"
cargo zigbuild -q --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -p podssh-cli --bin podssh --features "$(sed -n 's/^  RELEASE_FEATURES: //p' .github/workflows/release.yml)"
sh scripts/check-static.sh "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/debug/podssh"
